// Completes the taxonomy the rest of this qualitative suite left half-finished. skirmish.prism
// demonstrates sure = almost < limit (Buchi/reachability needing an escalating, infinite-
// memory retry schedule to approach probability 1). This model demonstrates the complementary
// pattern, sure < almost = limit: no deterministic strategy forces a match against an
// adversary who can always counter a *fixed* p1 action, but a single stationary 50/50 coin
// flip each round matches with probability exactly 1/2 regardless of the opponent's choice
// that round, so eventual success has probability exactly 1 -- achieved outright by a
// memoryless strategy, not merely approached.

// RESULT: false
<<p1>> sure [ F s=1 ]

// RESULT: true
<<p1>> almost [ F s=1 ]

// RESULT: true
<<p1>> limit [ F s=1 ]
